    "title": "WORLD PREMIERE: The Smashing Pumpkins - 'Black Stars' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Cerio ,\n27 minutes ago Universal Music / The Smashing Pumpkins The Smashing Pumpkins are the latest to add to the soundtrack for The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping , due out entirely on November 13. Hear the WORLD PREMIERE now of \"Black Stars\" on your favorite Audacy Rock station.\nFind your favorite station on the free Audacy app\n\"We just do what we believe in, we chase whatever the feeling is,\" Billy Corgan shared this week in a teaser for the track. \"I love franchise movies. I always think it's such a cool thing to be a part of a greater history.\"\nThe soundtrack for the latest installment from The Hunger Games arrives on November 13, with the film hitting theaters on November 20.\nDon't miss the WORLD PREMIERE of \"Black Stars\" now playing on your favorite Audacy Rock station .",
